# Anchor — Cursor rules

- Product is **Anchor** (see `PROJECT.md`). Hard Life Tech: Core OSS, Management SaaS private.
- Keep `AGENTS.md` authoritative for cross-tool agent notes; do not bloat it.
- Never read or commit `.env` / secrets. Never print `GITHUB_TOKEN`.
- Never export `GITHUB_TOKEN` into tmux panes — Anchor process environment only.
- Deny destructive shell: `rm -rf`, `sudo`, `dd`, `mkfs`.
- Safe git reads are fine; do not force-push; do not push/commit unless the user asks.
- Do not implement private SaaS features inside this OSS tree.
- Prefer updating docs when changing behavior described in `PROJECT.md` or `docs/`.
